    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Numbers 1-10: **uno, due, tre, quattro, cinque, sei, sette, otto, nove, dieci**. To tell time, Italian uses \"Sono le...\" (It is... o'clock), e.g. *Sono le tre* (It's three o'clock)." },
